Title: All-Ireland: Donegal 'deserve the right' to face Kerry in final - Jim McGuinness
Date: 2025-07-13
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Jim McGuinness', 'Text': '"We know what we will get with Kerry, they are a team who know their way around Croke Park like the back of their hand," McGuinness told BBC Sport.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 110}}, {'Speaker': 'Jim McGuinness', 'Text': '"They know how to win an All-Ireland so it\'s a massive, massive challenge but we\'ve deserved the right to play that game and I\'m delighted they\'ve got that opportunity.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 156}}, {'Speaker': 'Jim McGuinness', 'Text': '"Please god, now they can take it."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 5, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 34}}, {'Speaker': 'Jim McGuinness', 'Text': '"Full credit to the boys, they have done a brilliant job, and we got over the line today," McGuinness added.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 10, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 94}}, {'Speaker': 'Jim McGuinness', 'Text': '"I don\'t know about ruthless, but it was something we wanted to bring to the table, the opportunity to score goals and keep the scoreboard ticking over.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 11, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 142}}, {'Speaker': 'Jim McGuinness', 'Text': '"It had gone well in training in the last number of weeks, we felt there was a bit of a freshness in the group and thankfully it translated."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 12, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 116}}, {'Speaker': 'Jim McGuinness', 'Text': 'McGuinness said it was important to let the supporters enjoy the two-week build-up to the decider but "we have a job to do".', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 15, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 97}}, {'Speaker': 'Jim McGuinness', 'Text': '"We have to keep on the job now, prepare as best we can and stay focused on the things that are important.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 16, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 92}}, {'Speaker': 'Jim McGuinness', 'Text': '"I think the other part of it is very important for the fans but it\'s important that the two don\'t get diluted.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 17, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 102}}, {'Speaker': 'Jim McGuinness', 'Text': '"We have to bring the highest level possible to our performance."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 18, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 59}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'Jim McGuinness says his Donegal side have "deserved the right" to play for an All-Ireland championship against Kerry.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 96}}, {'Description': "Oisin Gallen, Ciaran Moore and Conor O'Donnell netted second-half goals as Donegal swatted Meath aside by 3-26 to 0-15 in their semi-final.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 112}}, {'Description': 'However, Donegal proved to be too big an ask as the Ulster champions ran out comfortable winners at Croke Park.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 7, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 92}}, {'Description': "McGuinness' side held a five-point margin at the break but goals from Gallen, Moore and man-of-the-match O'Donnell were more than enough to book their place in the final on 27 July.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 8, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 155}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'Jim McGuinness watches the match'}]}
